  ('Doctor of Philosophy in Earth, Atmospheric and Planetary Sciences','mit-phd-earth-atmospheric-planetary-sciences','Doctoral','e141f951-c20a-4495-893b-0d56476095e4','English','Typically 5 years','https://catalog.mit.edu/degree-charts/phd-earth-atmospheric-planetary-sciences/','Doctoral programme with fields including geology, geophysics, geobiology, climate and planetary sciences.'),
  ('Master of Science in Atmospheric Science','mit-sm-atmospheric-science','Master','e141f951-c20a-4495-893b-0d56476095e4','English','Varies','https://oge.mit.edu/programs/earth-atmospheric-and-planetary-sciences/','MIT EAPS master degree in atmospheric science.'),
