  ('MSc by Research in Earth Sciences','oxford-msc-research-earth-sciences','Master','9da82d0e-52a8-4e29-a76e-ad785ce1c887','English','2-3 years','https://www.ox.ac.uk/admissions/graduate/courses/msc-research-earth-sciences','Research-based Earth Sciences masters with themes including geophysics, geodynamics, geodesy, tectonics, climate and Earth resources.'),
  ('Intelligent Earth','oxford-intelligent-earth','Doctoral','9da82d0e-52a8-4e29-a76e-ad785ce1c887','English','Varies','https://www.ox.ac.uk/admissions/graduate/courses/departments/earth-sciences','UKRI Centre for Doctoral Training in AI for the Environment within Oxford Earth Sciences.'),
